,"id":49075096,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ5MDc1MDk2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/49075096?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rajukumaryb","html_url":"https://github.com/rajukumaryb","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rajukumaryb/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rajukumaryb/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rajukumaryb/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rajukumaryb/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rajukumaryb/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rajukumaryb/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rajukumaryb/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rajukumaryb/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rajukumaryb/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/comments/516516256","html_url":"https://github.com/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/1865#issuecomment-516516256","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/1865","id":516516256,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDUxNjUxNjI1Ng==","user":{"login":"ndeodhar","id":15746068,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE1NzQ2MDY4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/15746068?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ndeodhar","html_url":"https://github.com/ndeodhar","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ndeodhar/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ndeodhar/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ndeodhar/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ndeodhar/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ndeodhar/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ndeodhar/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ndeodhar/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ndeodhar/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ndeodhar/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2019-07-30T17:29:26Z","updated_at":"2019-07-30T17:29:26Z","body":"Recording some offline conversations here (to help debugging):\r\nPer @rajukumaryb's test, this is the request proto that was logged:\r\n```\r\nI0730 01:00:33.838732 26901 abstract_tablet.cc:78] PgsqlReadRequestPB: client: YQL_CLIENT_PGSQL\r\nschema_version: 0\r\nhash_code: 57005\r\ntargets {\r\n  column_id: 10\r\n}\r\ntargets {\r\n  column_id: 11\r\n}\r\ntargets {\r\n  column_id: 12\r\n}\r\ntargets {\r\n  column_id: 13\r\n}\r\ntargets {\r\n  column_id: 14\r\n}\r\ntargets {\r\n  column_id: 15\r\n}\r\ntargets {\r\n  column_id: -8\r\n}\r\ncolumn_refs {\r\n  ids: 10\r\n  ids: 11\r\n  ids: 12\r\n  ids: 13\r\n  ids: 14\r\n  ids: 15\r\n}\r\nis_forward_scan: true\r\nlimit: 1\r\npaging_state {\r\n  next_partition_key: \"\\336\\255\"\r\n  next_row_key: \"y\\005\\360\\240\\000\\000\\000\\000\\200\\0000\\000\\000\\2450\\000\\000O\\000\\000&\\274O\\000\\000\\000\\023O\\000\\000\\000\\023H\\200\\000\\000\\002$!#\\200\\001\\305bm\\376\\306X\\200J\"\r\n  total_num_rows_read: 1\r\n}\r\nreturn_paging_state: true\r\ntable_id: \"000030a5000030008000000000000a2b\"\r\nindex_request {\r\n  targets {\r\n    column_id: 15\r\n  }\r\n  column_refs {\r\n    ids: 15\r\n  }\r\n  range_column_values {\r\n    value {\r\n      uint32_value: 9916\r\n    }\r\n  }\r\n  range_column_values {\r\n    value {\r\n      uint32_value: 19\r\n    }\r\n  }\r\n  range_column_values {\r\n    value {\r\n      uint32_value: 19\r\n    }\r\n  }\r\n  table_id: \"000030a5000030008000000000000a5f\"\r\n}\r\n```\r\n\r\nError seen:\r\n```\r\n./bin/ysqlsh\r\nysqlsh: FATAL:  Query error: Invalid start_doc_key: \"y\\x05\\xf0\\xa0\\x00\\x00\\x00\\x00\\x80\\x000\\x00\\x00\\xa50\\x00\\x00O\\x00\\x00&\\xbcO\\x00\\x00\\x00\\x13O\\x00\\x00\\x00\\x13H\\x80\\x00\\x00\\x02$!\". Range: \"y\\x02\\xb0\\xa0\\x00\\x00\\x00\\x00\\x80\\x000\\x00\\x00\\xa50\\x00\\x00G\\xde\\xad\\x00!!\", \"y\\x02\\xb0\\xa0\\x00\\x00\\x00\\x00\\x80\\x000\\x00\\x00\\xa50\\x00\\x00~!\"\r\n```\r\n\r\nPer @m-iancu,\r\nIt’s a table with a nested index request — We have this optimization for system tables to do the table and index lookup in one request (since they are guaranteed to both be in one tablet — the master tablet).\r\nIn that case, if we need to do paging, we need to make sure whether we need the main table or index row key.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/comments/516516256/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"ndeodhar","id":15746068,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE1NzQ2MDY4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/15746068?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ndeodhar","html_url":"https://github.com/ndeodhar","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ndeodhar/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ndeodhar/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ndeodhar/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ndeodhar/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ndeodhar/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ndeodhar/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ndeodhar/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ndeodhar/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ndeodhar/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"id":2520600482,"node_id":"MDE0Ok1lbnRpb25lZEV2ZW50MjUyMDYwMDQ4Mg==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/events/2520600482","actor":{"login":"m-iancu","id":4038003,"node_id":"MDQ6